2026-07-27T07:16:10.9808425Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9808947Z i /tmp/RtmpzW0VyG/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9809287Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9809684Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9810383Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9810933Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9811756Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:16:10.9812382Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:16:11.0056316Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:16:11.0167903Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:16:11.0614888Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:16:11.0785059Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
